      },
      "note": [
        "The statistics include graduates from HVE programmes that ended the year before the follow-up year. Only graduates who are registered in Sweden during the follow-up year are included..\r\n\nThe statistics on the proportion of graduates with employment cover all HVE graduates..\r\n\nThe statistics include graduates who have employment (employment or own business) both before and after their HVE programme.\r\n\nThe statistics on the proportion of graduates in matching jobs include those who have employment (either as an employee or self-employed).\r\n\nThe statistics on the proportion of graduates in more qualified job tasks include those with employment both before and after their HVE programme.\r\n\nThe statistics on the proportion of graduates working with workplace training employers include those with employment after their HVE programme.\r\n\nThe statistics on the proportion of graduates working with the same employer include those with employment both before and after their HVE programme.\r\n\nThe statistics on the proportion of graduates with employment within 1 or 6 months include all graduates.\r\n\nThe statistics on the proportion of satisfied graduates include all graduates.",
        "The statistics are subject to uncertainty because not everyone responded to the survey. Therefore, a margin of error is always given. It is a range within which the true value is found with 95 percent certainty"
      ],
